English.RedeemPurcahsedItemsExplain:
We have a brand new inventory system so that you can access your items across platforms! Any items previously purchased on this platform can be transitioned over to our new inventory system ONLY ONCE.
If this is your main Among Us account (the platform you play Among Us the most on), you can safely click on "proceed" and redeem your purchased DLC in the new inventory system. If this is an account you intend to link to your main account, you should only redeem after linking!

